Error [E0326]: This pattern leaves out members of (after: Int, before: Int)
  --> tuple_destructure_partial_missing_rest.jet:2:5
    |
  2 |     { before: head } :: (before: 10, after: 20)
    |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: A destructure that doesn't name every member must end with `..` so the skipped members are visible at a glance
 Fix: Add `, ..` before the closing `}`, or name the remaining members
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0326
